msgid "Settlement rooted in Bitcoin."
msgstr "根植于 Bitcoin 的结算。"

msgid "BATHRON uses the N engine, verified Bitcoin facts and M0, a settlement asset created only by burning bitcoin."
msgstr "BATHRON 使用 N 引擎、经过验证的 Bitcoin 事实，以及仅通过销毁比特币创建的结算资产 M0。"

msgid "BATHRON"
msgstr "BATHRON"

msgid "Capabilities"
msgstr "功能"

msgid "Specification"
msgstr "规范"

msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档"

msgid "Bitcoin facts. Shared rules."
msgstr "Bitcoin 事实。共同规则。"

msgid "Each node verifies Bitcoin facts. M0 is the settlement asset, created only by burning bitcoin. N selects one producer per slot from burned tickets, without a vote."
msgstr "每个节点都验证 Bitcoin 事实。M0 是结算资产，仅通过销毁比特币创建。N 根据已销毁的票据为每个时隙抽选一个生产者，无需投票。"

