msgid "One settlement asset, no issuer."
msgstr "一种结算资产，没有发行方。"

msgid "M0 comes from burned bitcoin. Fees transfer existing M0; production creates no block reward. A burn creates no reserve and no claim on Bitcoin."
msgstr "M0 来自被销毁的比特币。手续费转移已有的 M0；生产区块不会产生区块奖励。销毁不会创建储备，也不会产生对 Bitcoin 的索偿权。"

msgid "N-SPEC v0.7 §1.4, invariants 2 and 12"
msgstr "N-SPEC v0.7 §1.4，不变量 2 和 12"

msgid "WHY-N §3"
msgstr "WHY-N §3"

msgid "Understand burns"
msgstr "了解销毁"

msgid "Wait or stop rather than be wrong."
msgstr "宁可等待或停止，也不出错。"

msgid "Participants choose depth within the published domain. Settlement may wait hours, and conflicts may halt progress. Outside that domain, N makes no quantitative claim; STOP need not occur."
msgstr "参与者在已公布的适用域内选择深度。结算可能等待数小时，冲突可能使进展停止。在该域之外，N 不作任何定量主张；STOP 不一定会触发。"

